-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 24.1.2008 (ארגון המורים) — תשלום בגין שחיקת שכרם של עובדי
-- הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002–2007: the agreement between the
-- employers (the State, the Centre of Local Government and the three large
-- cities) and ארגון המורים that settles, for the organisation's teachers,
-- the second period of the erosion arbitration and the year 2007 together.
-- Whom it covers (§2); a 4% rise of the combined salary table and of the
-- 1987 and 1994 supplements from the salary of January 2008, on December
-- 2007's values, and what is left to the arbitrators — compensation for
-- teachers who left in 2003–2007 (§3); the arbitration stopped save that
-- question, and the difference if הסתדרות המורים's arbitration gives more
-- (§4); exhaustion of the claims for 2002–2007 (§5).
--
-- THE CORPUS'S FILE NAME SAYS "AWARD" and the page denies it: this is the
-- agreement made after the award of 22.5.2007, not the award (the corpus's
-- reading ledger; renaming moves a work URI, MMS-86). A second, faxed copy
-- is `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_erosion-arbitration-1999-2001`
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/2008-01-24_oz-latmura_erosion-arbitration-1999-2001.l4),
-- which imports this file.
--
-- WHAT IT CARRIES OUT: the arbitration deed of 1.2.2007 (imported), whose
-- second period (1.1.02–31.12.06) it settles. הסתדרות המורים's agreement of
-- 21.2.2008 (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2008-02-21_teachers_erosion-arbitration-4pct-2002-2007.l4)
-- prints the same §3 for the union's teachers and imports this file.
--
-- NOT A CLAIM IN THE ROOT: the rise is on the salary table and the 1987
-- and 1994 supplements, which the root answers from the tables and
-- circulars that print them after the rise; no pay item stands for "4% on
-- December 2007's table", and this agreement is registered in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `2007-02-01_teachers_erosion-arbitration-deed`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the word the batch found is
-- "בעל-פה" (the parties plead before the arbitrators orally or in
-- writing); the agreement pays nothing by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תשלום בגין שחיקת שכר עובדי הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002–2007 (ארגון המורים, 24.1.2008)`

DECLARE `2008 erosion agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `plead before the erosion arbitrators on the former teachers' compensation`
    `publish the reasoned decision on the former teachers' compensation`
    `send the erosion arbitrators the joint notice that the arbitration stops`
    `repay the erosion compensation`
    `pay the teachers the difference of a higher erosion supplement given to הסתדרות המורים`
    `negotiate further on the erosion of 2002–2007`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15.6.2008, number 97/2008; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The second party, ארגון המורים, and its chairman; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The organisation's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the parties agreed in negotiation the rate of erosion for the second period and 2007 together, and how it is paid; the rules follow.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: they set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p16 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: the day of signing, written in by hand ("24-I-08").
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the Oz erosion agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 24 1 2008

-- ¶11: the arbitration deed of 1.2.07 ("הסכם הבוררות"), imported.
@ref akn:preamble/p11
`the Oz erosion agreement's arbitration deed was signed on` MEANS `the erosion arbitration deed was signed on`

-- ¶12: the panel gave its award for 1.1.99–31.12.01 on 22.5.07. The corpus
-- does not hold the award.
@ref akn:preamble/p12
`the first erosion award was given on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 22 5 2007

`why the first erosion award is not read here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "פסק הבוררות בעניין שחיקת שכר עובדי ההוראה לתקופה 1.1.99–31.12.01, מיום 22.5.07"

-- ¶13: the panel is hearing the second period, 1.1.02–31.12.06 ("התקופה
-- השנייה") — the deed's second part.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
`the second period this agreement settles` MEANS `the second erosion period, 2002 to 2006`

#ASSERT `the first erosion award was given on` `is on or after` `the Oz erosion agreement's arbitration deed was signed on`

§§ `1 מבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the Oz erosion agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §2: every employee in the employers' service in post-primary education,
-- in the teaching scale, represented by the organisation ("עובדי הוראה").
-- The employers are the State and the local authorities, the three large
-- cities among them; another owner's teacher is outside it (convention
-- instruments.agreement-scope).
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee of the Oz erosion agreement` c IF
        NOT `is an owning body` (c's `employer`)
    AND c's `in post-primary education`
    AND c's `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation`

§§ `3 תשלום בגין שחיקת שכרם של עובדי הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002 - 2007`

-- (א): on top of the supplement the teachers began to get from the salary
-- of January 2007 under the award of 22.5.07 (for 1.1.99–31.12.01), for the
-- erosion of 2002–2007 the combined salary table, תוספת 87' and תוספת 94'
-- are raised, from the salary of January 2008, by a wage supplement of 4%.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a
DECLARE `what the 2008 erosion rise raises` IS ONE OF
    `the combined salary table, raised for erosion`
    `the 1987 supplement, raised for erosion`
    `the 1994 supplement, raised for erosion`

`the 2008 erosion rise` MEANS 4%

`the first erosion award's supplement was paid from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2007

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 erosion rise on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) THEN `the 2008 erosion rise` ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the 2008 erosion rise on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) EQUALS (4%)
#ASSERT `the 2008 erosion rise on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2007) EQUALS 0

-- (ב): the rise is made on the pay as it stood in December 2007. Each of
-- the three is raised by 4% of its own December 2007 value: what is added
-- is that, and nothing compounds on a later update.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `its value in December 2007` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2008 erosion rise added to a component` d `its value in December 2007` IS
    `the 2008 erosion rise on` d TIMES `its value in December 2007`

#ASSERT `the 2008 erosion rise added to a component` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 2008) 5000 EQUALS 200

-- For the teacher of a case: the rise of the combined salary, a teaching
-- employee of this agreement's, on the case's December 2007 combined salary.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz erosion rise of the combined salary` c IS
    IF `a teaching employee of the Oz erosion agreement` c
    THEN `the 2008 erosion rise added to a component` (c's `the salary month`) (c's `combined salary in December 2007`)
    ELSE 0

-- (ג)–(ד): who may be compensated, asked of a teacher who left. (ג): one
-- who gets a pension from an accumulating fund, or who ended work not by
-- retiring on a pension; who was an active teacher in 2002–2007 or part of
-- it; and who ended work in 2003–2007.
@desc A teacher who left, as §3(ג)–(ד) of the erosion agreements of 2008 ask about him.
DECLARE `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation` HAS
    `gets a pension from an accumulating fund` IS A BOOLEAN
    `ended work not by retiring on a pension` IS A BOOLEAN
    `was an active teacher in some of 2002–2007` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the year work ended` IS A NUMBER
    `was inactive in 2003–2007 for unpaid leave or a sabbatical` IS A BOOLEAN @desc not active in those years, or part of them, because on unpaid leave or a sabbatical
    `moved to another of the employers and is employed by one in 2008` IS A BOOLEAN @desc ended work at one employer in 2003–2007, moved to another as a teacher, and is still employed by one of the employers in 2008

@ref akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN t IS A `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the erosion compensation group as (ג) describes it` t IF
        (t's `gets a pension from an accumulating fund` OR t's `ended work not by retiring on a pension`)
    AND t's `was an active teacher in some of 2002–2007`
    AND t's `the year work ended` AT LEAST 2003
    AND t's `the year work ended` AT MOST 2007

-- (ד): for the avoidance of doubt, the group leaves out a teacher not
-- active in 2003–2007 or part of it for unpaid leave or a sabbatical, and
-- one who ended work at one of the employers then, moved to another as a
-- teacher and is employed by one of them in 2008.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN t IS A `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the Oz erosion compensation group` t IF
        `in the erosion compensation group as (ג) describes it` t
    AND NOT t's `was inactive in 2003–2007 for unpaid leave or a sabbatical`
    AND NOT t's `moved to another of the employers and is employed by one in 2008`

`a retiree of 2005 on an accumulating fund` MEANS
    `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation` WITH
        `gets a pension from an accumulating fund` IS TRUE
        `ended work not by retiring on a pension` IS FALSE
        `was an active teacher in some of 2002–2007` IS TRUE
        `the year work ended` IS 2005
        `was inactive in 2003–2007 for unpaid leave or a sabbatical` IS FALSE
        `moved to another of the employers and is employed by one in 2008` IS FALSE

`a teacher who resigned in 2005` MEANS
    `teacher who left, for the erosion compensation` WITH
        `gets a pension from an accumulating fund` IS FALSE
        `ended work not by retiring on a pension` IS TRUE
        `was an active teacher in some of 2002–2007` IS TRUE
        `the year work ended` IS 2005
        `was inactive in 2003–2007 for unpaid leave or a sabbatical` IS FALSE
        `moved to another of the employers and is employed by one in 2008` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `in the Oz erosion compensation group` `a retiree of 2005 on an accumulating fund`
#ASSERT `in the Oz erosion compensation group` `a teacher who resigned in 2005`

-- (ג), the rest: whether such a teacher is compensated, how much and how,
-- is for the arbitrators, in the arbitration under the deed; the parties
-- may plead before them, orally or in writing as they agree, before the
-- decision.
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
`the former teachers' erosion compensation` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "צוות הבוררים, בהליך הבוררות לפי שטר הבוררות מיום 1.2.2007"

`pleading on the former teachers' compensation` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    MAY   `plead before the erosion arbitrators on the former teachers' compensation`

-- (ד), last sentence: a teacher awarded compensation under (ג) who comes
-- back to work as a teacher with one of the employers by September 2009,
-- that month included, repays it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN `the month he came back` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `he came back by the Oz agreement's last month for repaying` `the month he came back` IF
    `the month he came back` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2009)

GIVEN `the month he came back` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2008 erosion agreement action`
DECIDE `repaying the Oz erosion compensation` `the month he came back` IS
    IF `he came back by the Oz agreement's last month for repaying` `the month he came back`
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MUST  `repay the erosion compensation`
    ELSE FULFILLED

#ASSERT `he came back by the Oz agreement's last month for repaying` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009)
#ASSERT NOT `he came back by the Oz agreement's last month for repaying` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2009)

-- (ה): the arbitrators publish their reasoned decision on (ג) within 30
-- days of getting the parties' joint notice under §4, and may extend it by
-- 60 days more as needed.
@ref akn:art_3__para_e
`days for the decision on the former teachers' compensation` MEANS 30
`further days the arbitrators may take for it` MEANS 60

`the decision on the former teachers' compensation` MEANS
    PARTY `the erosion arbitrators`
    MUST  `publish the reasoned decision on the former teachers' compensation`
    WITHIN `days for the decision on the former teachers' compensation`

§§ `4 הליך הבוררות`

-- (א): the arbitration under the deed for 1.1.02–31.12.06 stops when this
-- agreement is signed, save on (ג); the parties' joint notice goes to the
-- panel right after.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a
`the Oz erosion agreement stops the arbitration for the second period, save §3(ג)` MEANS TRUE

`the joint notice to the erosion arbitrators` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `send the erosion arbitrators the joint notice that the arbitration stops`

-- (ב): if the arbitration with הסתדרות המורים for 1.1.02–31.12.06 goes on
-- beyond (ג), and the supplement it gives is higher than the one agreed
-- here, the difference is paid to this agreement's teachers too.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN `the Histadrut arbitration went on beyond §3(ג)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the supplement it gave` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the difference owed the Oz teachers` `the Histadrut arbitration went on beyond §3(ג)` `the supplement it gave` IS
    IF `the Histadrut arbitration went on beyond §3(ג)` AND `the supplement it gave` GREATER THAN `the 2008 erosion rise`
    THEN `the supplement it gave` MINUS `the 2008 erosion rise`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the difference owed the Oz teachers` TRUE (5%) EQUALS (1%)
#ASSERT `the difference owed the Oz teachers` FALSE (5%) EQUALS 0

`paying the Oz teachers a higher Histadrut supplement` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay the teachers the difference of a higher erosion supplement given to הסתדרות המורים`

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- §5: full exhaustion of the claims on the erosion against the engineers
-- for 1.1.02–31.12.07, the 1993–1995 wage agreements' among them; no
-- further negotiation on it.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Oz erosion agreement exhausts the erosion claim for` y IF
    y AT LEAST 2002 AND y AT MOST 2007

`no further negotiation on the erosion of 2002–2007` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `negotiate further on the erosion of 2002–2007`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 "In witness whereof"; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties' names under the signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The Treasury's reference שכ. 2007-8642; no rule.
